        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION B.1. Employees on incentive plans other than the Team Performance Award will receive a wage adjustment to the next higher rate on the higher wage schedule, which results in a minimum increase of no less than seventy-five ($0.75) per hour.",
